      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Flatten into Cover</h1><p><em>The cat lowers its body into the broken outline of the brush.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-great-cat-flatten-into-cover</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>In actual concealment, gain 1 Boon to its next hiding roll before turn end. This is not a free Hide action or automatic Hidden.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
